      "id": "false-clear",
      "status": "reproduced",
      "subject": "checks",
      "statement": "Existing, unfixed defect: two synthetic counterexamples reported clear with incomplete receipt coverage or an unmapped required hook; the appropriate result is unknown. This proves those check paths, not every live concern closure. No policy repair was made in this modeling lane.",
